/T (The Simple Event Registration System is a Java-based console application designed to simulate an organized event registration desk. The main objective of this project is to provide a structured and fair registration environment where participants can register for events, cancel registrations, view confirmed participants, and inspect waiting lists.)
/E (The Simple Event Registration System is a Java-based console application designed to simulate an organized event registration desk. The main objective of this project is to provide a structured and fair registration environment where participants can register for events, cancel registrations, view confirmed participants, and inspect waiting lists.)
