/S /H3
/P 54 0 R
/T (The Simple Event Registration System is a Java-based console application developed to demonstrate the working of a college event registration desk. The project allows the operator to register participants, cancel a registration, display confirmed registrations, and show the waiting list through a simple menu-driven interface.)
/E (The Simple Event Registration System is a Java-based console application developed to demonstrate the working of a college event registration desk. The project allows the operator to register participants, cancel a registration, display confirmed registrations, and show the waiting list through a simple menu-driven interface.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
