/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 54 0 R
/T (The events supported in the project are Tech Fest, Music Night, and Sports Day, with each event having a capacity of 50 seats and registration IDs starting from REG101. File handling is used to store and retrieve records through a text file named events.txt, ensuring that registration records are maintained even after the program is closed.)
/E (The events supported in the project are Tech Fest, Music Night, and Sports Day, with each event having a capacity of 50 seats and registration IDs starting from REG101. File handling is used to store and retrieve records through a text file named events.txt, ensuring that registration records are maintained even after the program is closed.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
