/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 54 0 R
/T (This project uses various Data Structures and Algorithms, including HashMap, ArrayList, and Queue. A HashMap is used to map each event name \(Tech Fest, Music Night, and Sports Day\) to its registration records so that event details can be accessed quickly. An ArrayList stores the confirmed participants up to a limit of 50 seats per event, while a FIFO Queue manages the waiting list whenever an event becomes full.)
/E (This project uses various Data Structures and Algorithms, including HashMap, ArrayList, and Queue. A HashMap is used to map each event name \(Tech Fest, Music Night, and Sports Day\) to its registration records so that event details can be accessed quickly. An ArrayList stores the confirmed participants up to a limit of 50 seats per event, while a FIFO Queue manages the waiting list whenever an event becomes full.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
