/T (Each event is paired with a FIFO Queue for its waiting list. When all 50 seats of an event are full, new participants are added to the rear of that event's queue with Waiting status. When a confirmed registration is cancelled, the participant at the front of the queue is automatically removed from the queue and promoted to Confirmed status.)
/E (Each event is paired with a FIFO Queue for its waiting list. When all 50 seats of an event are full, new participants are added to the rear of that event's queue with Waiting status. When a confirmed registration is cancelled, the participant at the front of the queue is automatically removed from the queue and promoted to Confirmed status.)
