/Title (The Simple Event Registration System is a Java-based console application designed to simulate an organized event registration desk. The main objective of this project is to provide a structured and fair registration environment where participants can register for events, cancel registrations, view confirmed participants, and inspect waiting lists.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 751 0 R
/Next 849 0 R
>>
endobj
810 0 obj
<<
/Title (File handling is used to load previously saved registrations from events.txt when the application starts and to save all records when the application exits. Overall, this project demonstrates the practical implementation of Java programming concepts, data structures, and file handling in a real-world event management scenario.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 751 0 R
/Prev 850 0 R
>>
endobj
